  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You summon earth rock to burst forth and constrict around your target.</p><p>Choose a target within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. It must succeed on an opposed <strong>Reflexes</strong> check or become <strong>Restrained</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Regardless of whether the target succeeded on its opposed check, you may choose to inflict <strong>1 Damage</strong>, as the earth attempts to crush the target.</p><p>An affected creature or an adjacent ally can use an <strong>Action</strong> to make a <strong>6:1 Body (Athletics)</strong> check to end the Restrained effect.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the duration of the <strong>Restrained</strong> effect by <strong>+1 rounds</strong> per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.QC7sAiFKdzNM1q3K]{Grasping Earth}</p>",
